        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-23T23:45:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Tolkein was neither Chinese nor Japanese, nor was he a Buddhist - he took his inspiration from European folklore and language as well as his own religion. If he'd tried to include \"sets\" of <span class=\"bbcode-i\">every</span> number between one and ten in some way I suspect it might have ended up being a bit silly.</p>",
