      {
        "id": 87398,
        "name": "Greywind",
        "username": "Greywind",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/{size}/2006_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-24T21:03:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Reckless\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/48/2467_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Reckless:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Greywind wrote:</b><br><blockquote>I have no love for the Rainbow Lantern Corp.  :stuck_out_tongue: \n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nThat's a shame.&nbsp; Blackest Night was an incredible story, and was much better quality than the current Green Lantern comics.&nbsp; Ever since that \"War of the Green Lanterns\" arc it's all gone downhill...So the other rings actually provided some mythical such-and-such?&nbsp; That's news to me!&nbsp; I've only seen the flicks, as I stopped reading Fellowship in grade school after Tom Bombadil bored me to tears.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Anything that resurrected Hal Jordan and ceased Rayner's run as the one true Green Lantern pretty much killed it for me.</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:11:40.599Z",
